  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text { Net work done in a cycle } & =W_{A B}+W_{B C}+W_{C B}+W_{B A} \\\\\n& =400 R+2 \\times 2.303 \\times 500 R \\ln 2-400 R-414 R \\\\\n& =1000 R \\times \\ln 2-600 R \\times \\ln 2=400 R \\times \\ln 2=276 R\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
